From 6fe46fa9f0c0ae4d77c41b3aec5f5432ed445ed0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:31:49 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD strict selected-agent slash commands to preserve
 backend semantics

Selected-agent chat input that starts with a slash is routed through the backend command execution contract instead of the normal prompt path. Codex resumes the active thread with the raw command text and records command-originated input separately so commands that fork or update the provider thread keep subsequent resumes attached to the correct session.
